    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "\"The Coldplay Show\" is the most authentic tribute, bringing the closest sonic and visual performance experience imaginable, featuring the biggest hits of all-time that include: Clocks, Scientist, Adventure of a Lifetime, Sky Full of Stars, Yellow, Paradise, Fix You, Something Just Like This, My Universe, Higher Power, Trouble and other recognizable chart-toppers."
