        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Directors Cut : From Script to Screen Movie Camp | Astor Theatre & Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Returning for the third year, this week-long afternoon camp allows children to find out all about what goes on behind the camera. Budding filmmaker and long-time Astor Theatre friend, Easton Goodwin, will work in a group to formulate an idea, create a script and storyboard, and then film your masterpiece! The week will finish with watching your movie on the big screen (complete with the famous Astor popcorn!)"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
