        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Astor Academy Radio Theatre Camp allows campers aged 8–17 to learn to create audio-driven dramas, with a focus on voice acting, sound effects, scriptwriting, and audio editing. In this camp, we will record, polish, and perform a radio play on a community radio station."
      }
