        "@value": "On Sunday, June 28th, our Spotlight Guild will be performing their original production \"The Pirate's Tempest.\"   An exiled Pirate King uses his magic to conjure a storm to complete his ultimate revenge.  Our take on Shakespeare's The Tempest brings a pirate's tale full of betrayal,  love, revenge and a few laughs along the way. "
      }
