        "@value": "Do you think you know the real story of The 3 Little Pigs? Well, maybe there is another side to the story. Come join our March Break Theatre Campers as they perform this classic tale with a twist! These young actors have worked so hard and have put together the production \"The True'ish' Story of The 3 Little Pigs\" in just one week!"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "https://astortheatre.ca/event/the-trueish-story-of-the-3-little-pigs/"
