        "@value": "February Big Stage Open Mic Night | Astor Theatre & Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Our next Big Stage Open Mic Night will feature a special guest host, Nicole Whynot! A fantastic evening featuring local community talent. You can sing, dance, tell jokes, read a poem, play the piano - you have a talent- we want to see it! You can sign up the night of the event at 6 p.m. at our Box Office Just want to watch? No problem, this is a free, all-ages event. Come on out and support local talent in our community!"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#url": [
