        "@value": "Beth Lenco Winter Still Life Drawing Retreat | Astor Theatre & Arts Centre"
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Spend an afternoon with Beth as your guide as you learn essential drawing and seeing techniques that will ignite your art practice. After years of blood, sweat, and tears, Beth has learned that there is no other way to learn to draw than to draw. But drawing can be playful and fun while you practice getting in those pencil hours."
      }
    ],
    "https://ogp.me/ns#url": [
