        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Ever wanted to perform on The Astor Stage?  Well, now is your chance to have your moment in the spotlight! Sing, play an instrument (our grand piano will be available), tell jokes, read a poem...be prepared to shine! No need to register, sign up on the night."
