        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come celebrate the holidays with us for a special Christmas-themed Big Stage Open Mic Night! Have your moment in the spotlight! Sing, play an instrument (our grand piano will be available), tell jokes, read a poem...be prepared to shine! No need to register, sign up on the night."
      }
