    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://astortheatre.ca/event/a-homeland-christmas-we-are-canadian/2026-12-12/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A Homeland Christmas – We ARE Canadian!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Christmas and the holiday season for those of different cultures is important. It\\'s a time to gather as community . And in solidarity for all we hold dear. The memories we gather.....Those we remember.....The young ones we encourage. The beautiful life we live here...in Canada.</p>\\n<p>Homeland Christmas is a gathering ... and... a wonderful one! It pairs the best of professional musicians from Canada with much of our very own talent and brings together a magnificent cast to give you the best of Christmas and the holiday season on Broadway right here at home.</p>\\n<p>Don your Christmas and holiday finery as will we, and truly celebrate this beautiful place we call home. Come early. Celebrate with a glass of something nice. Find friends and make new ones. It\\'s easy when there are friends easily found!</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/performer": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Organization"
      }
