    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "John Wing – Go East, Old Man With Special Guest Dan Mitchelmore"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>⭐ The Man, The Myth, The Credits ⭐</p>\\n<p>John Wing\\'s resume reads like a history book of late-night television and world-renowned comedy stages. He has amassed over 350 television appearances across North America.</p>\\n<p>John will be joined by Halifax comedian Dan Mitchelmore, one of the rising young voices in Nova Scotia\\'s comedy scene. Dan has been performing stand-up across the city and province for the past two years. He\\'s known for his approachable style, crowd engagement, and ability to create a fun atmosphere wherever he perform</p>\\n<p>John will also be using a special Guitar during the show which will be donated to Guitars for Vets after the tour. We welcome Vets and Family members to sign the guitar case or place a card in it with a special message for the Vet that will receive it.</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
