        "@value": "Shark Week : Shark Tale (2004)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>When a son of a gangster shark boss is accidently killed while on the hunt, his would-be prey and his vegetarian brother both decide to use the incident to their own advantage.</p>\\n"
      }
