    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Andrew Morrisey Camp Production"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Andrew is a NY-based actor and teacher, originally from Truro, and has been running his camps in theatres around NS for the last 17 summers!</p>\\n<p>Andrew is a Music Theatre graduate of several programs, including Circle in the Square Theatre School’s Acting program in NYC -the only accredited training attached to a Broadway theatre. As a teacher, he has worked with voice students who have performed in regional theatres across the US, on national tours, and on Broadway. </p>\\n<p>Andrew has worked hard with this campers this week to perform selections from a few musicals, but we are keeping it under our hats to which ones :)  Come and see how amazing our Astor Academy Youth are and how much they have learned in one week!  </p>\\n"
      }
    ],
