        "@value": "Curtain Call Academy with Lincoln Inglis"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Now in its fifth year, Lincoln puts his spin on the decades-long Astor Theatre Camp tradition. In this one-of-a-kind program, Lincoln will explore campers’ creativity by developing an original play from start to finish, learning plenty of theatre skills along the way!</p>\\n"
      }
