    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>What if you could talk to animals and understand what they\\'re saying? In Disney and Pixar\\'s all-new feature film \"Hoppers,\" scientists have discovered how to \"hop\" human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals!</p>\\n"
