    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Do you think you know the real story of The 3 Little Pigs? Well, maybe there is another side to the story.<br />\\nCome join our March Break Theatre Campers as they perform this classic tale with a twist!<br />\\nThese young actors have worked so hard and have put together the production \"The True\\'ish\\' Story of The 3 Little Pigs\" in just one week!</p>\\n"
      }
