    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Shakespeare’s great love story is brilliantly retold through this modern ballet classic celebrating its 60th anniversary in 2025. The fervent longing of the star-crossed lovers is perfectly captured by Kenneth MacMillan’s impassioned choreography.</p>\\n"
