        "@value": "Sinners (2025)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Sinners (2025) is a supernatural horror film directed by Ryan Coogler and starring Michael B. Jordan in a dual role. Set in 1932 Mississippi, the story follows twin brothers, former gangsters fleeing their past, who return to their hometown to open a juke joint, only to confront a terrifying supernatural evil.</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
