        "@value": "Campbell and Johnston"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Campbell & Johnston: A Modern guitar-driven blues steeped in Classic Rock & Roots<br />\\nWhether performing as an acoustic duo or fronting a full electric band, they deliver a seamless interplay of blistering guitar solos, soulful vocals, and rich harmonies. Their live shows pulse with raw energy and emotional intimacy, leaving audiences both exhilarated and deeply moved.</p>\\n"
      }
