        "@value": "One Battle After Another"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Bob is a washed-up revolutionary who lives in a state of stoned paranoia, surviving off-grid with his spirited and self-reliant daughter, Willa. When his evil nemesis resurfaces, and Willa goes missing, the former radical scrambles to find her as both father and daughter battle the consequences of their pasts.</p>\\n"
      }
