        "@value": "<p>Ever wanted to perform on The Astor Stage?  Well, now is your chance to have your moment in the spotlight!<br />\\nSing, play an instrument (our grand piano will be available), tell jokes, read a poem...be prepared to shine!<br />\\nNo need to register, sign up on the night.</p>\\n"
      }
    ],
